  "summary": "<p>Last night, President Donald J. Trump unveiled the Trump Dividend — a historic $5,000 cash payment to every adult American citizen, made possible by the strength of the American economy under his leadership. The announcement is the latest proof that President Trump does what the so-called “experts” say cannot be done: he delivers for the [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/09/trump-dividend-america-is-winning-and-americans-should-win-with-it/\">Trump Dividend: America Is Winning — and Americans Should Win With It</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
